.TH PHP-PROJ 7 "2024-06-07" "php-proj 2.0.0" "PHP Extensions"
.SH NAME
php-proj \- PHP bindings for PROJ cartographic projections library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B <?php
.B declare(strict_types=1);
.B 
.B // Global functions
.B proj_get_authorities(): array
.B proj_get_codes(string $auth_name, ?string $pj_type = null, bool $allow_deprecated = false): array
.B proj_get_crs_info_list_from_database(?string $auth_name = null, ...): array
.B proj_is_network_enabled(): bool
.B proj_set_network_enabled(bool $enabled = true): void
.B proj_get_user_data_dir(bool $create = false): ?string
.B proj_set_user_data_dir(?string $path = null): void
.B 
.B // Main classes
.B class ProjCRS { /* CRS creation and properties */ }
.B class ProjTransformer { /* Coordinate transformations */ }
.B class ProjGeod { /* Geodetic calculations */ }
.B class ProjTransformerGroup { /* Transformation groups */ }
.B 
.B // Object Model classes
.B class ProjCoordinateSystem { /* Coordinate system objects */ }
.B class ProjAxis { /* Individual coordinate axis properties */ }
.B class ProjDatum { /* Geodetic reference frame objects */ }
.B class ProjEllipsoid { /* Ellipsoid parameter objects */ }
.B class ProjPrimeMeridian { /* Prime meridian objects */ }
.B class ProjCoordinateOperation { /* Coordinate transformation operations */ }
.B class ProjAreaOfUse { /* Area of use boundaries */ }
.B ?>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B php-proj
extension provides comprehensive PHP bindings for the PROJ cartographic projections library. It enables coordinate transformations, geodetic calculations, and coordinate reference system (CRS) management in PHP applications.

The extension follows standard PHP extension naming conventions with classes in the global namespace using the
.I Proj
prefix and global functions using the
.I proj_
prefix.

